-- SCOPE (SRM21 audits) of the six new theorems P2 `runModuleTG_depth2_depth1_of_grandInstFree`, P3 `resetNk_depth_lift`, P4 `qDepthLift_of_grandInstFree`, the topshareQ instances `topshareQ_grandInstFree`, `topshareQ_qDepthLift`
-- and the corollary `topshareQ_svBoundsH_underComposedG'` (SRM20's theorem without the `hlift` binder), and of the four new definitions GrandInstFree, QGrandInstFree, GkCorr, KidCorr.
-- (1) PREMISE TABLE (index, binderInfo, name, Prop-or-data, type) equal to `Tests/Compiler/Srm21AuditExpected.lean` and `scripts/srm21/PREMISES.txt`, `S21THM` marker per theorem, literal count guard (6);
-- three semantic negative fixtures (` ∧ True` on a Prop binder, added data binder, reordered binders), each non-vacuous and rejected.  REGENERATION: build Tests.Compiler.Srm21AuditTest, then `python3 scripts/srm21/gen_audit.py LOG`.
-- (2) INDEPENDENT FULL-TYPE EXPECTED STATEMENTS: `Tests/Compiler/Srm21ExpStmt.lean`, GENERATED by scripts/srm21/gen_exp.py from the text scripts/srm21/EXPECTED.txt (fixed before any proof), the SRM12 `topshareQ_corr` binders and the SRM20 statement with the single binder
--     `hlift` deleted; `isDefEq` to each final type and to each definition body; five wrong expected forms (instance-free hypothesis dropped from P2 and from P3, depth of P2's run swapped, first conjunct only of QGrandInstFree, the SRM20 statement with hlift kept) are rejected.
-- (3) the corollary has no QDepthLift anywhere in its type, no hlift/hrun binder; QDepthLift is not defeq to any Prop binder type of the new theorems (no relabelling); GrandInstFree is stated through childMap/instFree and mentions neither QDepthLift, runModuleTG nor ResetNk.
-- (4) CLOSURE: standard axioms; forbidden old-form roots (with control); SRM20's theorem and the generic P2/P3 are in the corollary's closure.  NOTE: SRM21's own lemmas (Tools/ShippingSrm21Lift.lean) step `evalAssignsKG_instFree`, not `runKS_instFree`; whether `runKS_instFree` / `runModuleTG_instFree` occur in the corollary's closure (through SRM20's theorem and earlier units) is printed in S21CLOSURE2, not required.
